{title: RAVORAVO}
{artist: MIKA & DAVIS}
{key: DO}
{singers: Ketaka, Misa, Toky, Haja}
{musicians: Toky=Guitare, Haja=Guitare basse, Manitra=Percussion}

Manakory ’nareo,
tsara be mifantsafa
Mbarakaly ’nareo ô,
ino vaovao ino maresaka
amina’ reto

Manakory nareo,
tsara be mifagnotsafa
Mbarakaly ’nareo ô, i
no vaovao ino maresaka
amina’ reto

Ts’isy vaovao ts’isy maresaka,
salama tsara be [×2]

Nahatongavanay atôy
moa ts’isy raha marobe
’Zay mitady ny tsara,
’zay mitady hafaliana,
’Zay mitady ny soa,
’zay mitady fitiavana,
’Zay mitady vaovao mahafaly

Nahatongavanay atôy...

Nihavianay avy tany,
tsisy raha mampalahelo ô
Ary tsisy raha tokony hampiady
F’zay manimanina no tonga mamangy

Tsara zalahy manimanina e,
misaotra mamangy [×2]

Nahatongavanay atoy moa
ts’isy raha marobe
’Zay mitady ny tsara,
’zay mitady hafaliana,
’Zay mitady ny soa,
’zay mitady fitiavana,
’Zay mitady vaovao mahafaly

Ravoravo o,
’zay tonga atôy
Feno hafaliana mahita anareo
Ravoravo o,
’zay tonga aminareo io o
